                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6b06a442-01dd-40b0-866f-ffb41f72fe89",
                                "sense_id": "1d917efe-425e-3054-a45a-9a30f383b2d1",
                                "text": "— Чу́дная! — лепе́чет писа́тель, целу́я ру́ку о́коло брасле́та. — Не вас целу́ю, ди́вная, а страда́ние челове́ческое! По́мните Раско́льникова? Он так целова́л.",
                                "translation": "\"Exquisite creature!\" murmured the author, kissing her hand close to the bracelet. \"It's not you I am kissing, but the suffering of humanity. Do you remember Raskolnikov and his kiss?\"",
                                "english": "\"Exquisite creature!\" murmured the author, kissing her hand close to the bracelet. \"It's not you I am kissing, but the suffering of humanity. Do you remember Raskolnikov and his kiss?\""
                            }
